  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Returnees as Messengers III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on the successful pilot and follow-up project of 2018 and 2019 implemented in Iraq and Afghanistan and will now also include Pakistan to further support target communities in making an informed decision on whether or not to migrate and the different migration pathways. The goal is that the target communities are aware and better informed on topics related to irregular migration and voluntary return through a peer-to-peer awareness raising campaign and use the information as a basis for making their migration decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
